e",76.7,76.82],["just",76.82,77.06],["make",77.06,77.3]]},{"start":77.3,"end":82.66,"text":"a note of what courses you might be interested in changing to. Well there are","words":[["a",77.3,77.44],["note",77.44,77.74],["of",77.74,77.96],["what",77.96,78.22],["courses",78.22,78.74],["you",78.74,79.0],["might",79.0,79.16],["be",79.16,79.3],["interested",79.3,79.72],["in",79.72,80.28],["changing",80.28,80.66],["to.",80.66,81.0],["Well",81.42,81.96],["there",81.96,82.54],["are",82.54,82.66]]},{"start":82.66,"end":87.58,"text":"several that I've thought about but what I'd like to do most is politics. Well","words":[["several",82.66,83.0],["that",83.0,83.22],["I've",83.22,83.42],["thought",83.42,83.58],["about",83.58,83.92],["but",83.92,84.22],["what",84.22,84.48],["I'd",84.48,84.7],["like",84.7,84.92],["to",84.92,85.12],["do",85.12,85.26],["most",85.26,85.62],["is",85.62,85.94],["politics.",85.94,86.42],["Well",87.16,87.58]]},{"start":87.58,"end":93.14,"text":"that is a very popular course. I know and there might not be places but sure","words":[["that",87.58,88.18],["is",88.18,88.46],["a",88.46,88.68],["very",88.68,88.96],["popular",88.96,89.4],["course.",89.4,89.84],["I",90.26,90.38],["know",90.38,90.62],["and",90.62,91.22],["there",91.22,91.32],["might",91.32,91.46],["not",91.46,91.6],["be",91.6,91.74],["places",91.74,92.2],["but",92.2,92.6],["sure",92.6,93.14]]},{"start":93.14,"end":98.76,"text":"I'll certainly take a note of that but what about another option? Well I had","words":[["I'll",93.14,93.88],["certainly",93.88,94.3],["take",94.3,94.64],["a",94.64,94.74],["note",94.74,94.88],["of",94.88,95.02],["that",95.02,95.2],["but",95.2,96.32],["what",96.32,96.62],["about",96.62,96.82],["another",96.82,97.14],["option?",97.14,97.54],["Well",98.06,98.34],["I",98.34,98.58],["had",98.58,98.76]]},{"start":98.76,"end":102.84,"text":"thought of changing course completely and trying business studies but then","words":[["thought",98.76,98.9],["of",98.9,99.08],["changing",99.08,99.4],["course",99.4,99.72],["completely",99.72,100.26],["and",100.26,100.62],["trying",100.62,100.86],["business",100.86,101.2],["studies",101.2,101.66],["but",101.66,102.56],["then",102.56,102.84]]},{"start":102.84,"end":111.25,"text":"realized it wasn't really me. So I thought of philosophy. Before you hear the","words":[["realized",102.84,103.28],["it",103.28,103.72],["wasn't",103.72,103.96],["really",103.96,104.18],["me.",104.18,104.52],["So",104.96,105.48],["I",105.48,105.86],["thought",105.86,105.98],["of",105.98,106.14],["philosophy.",106.14,106.6],["Before",110.21,110.53],["you",110.53,110.79],["hear",110.79,111.07],["the",111.07,111.25]]},{"start":111.25,"end":117.17,"text":"rest of the discussion you have some time to look at questions 25 to 30 on page","words":[["rest",111.25,111.51],["of",111.51,111.65],["the",111.65,111.73],["discussion",111.73,112.13],["you",112.13,112.95],["have",112.95,113.17],["some",113.17,113.35],["time",113.35,113.79],["to",113.79,114.09],["look",114.09,114.21],["at",114.21,114.35],["questions",114.35,114.63],["25",114.63,115.55],["to",115.55,115.79],["30",115.79,116.17],["on",116.17,116.89],["page",116.89,117.17]]},{"start":117.17,"end":147.42,"text":"5. Now listen and answer questions 25 to 30. Right well that's useful to know but","words":[["5.",117.17,117.67],["Now",137.96,138.26],["listen",138.26,138.6],["and",138.6,139.04],["answer",139.04,139.44],["questions",139.44,139.82],["25",139.82,140.76],["to",140.76,141.02],["30.",141.02,141.42],["Right",144.84,145.3],["well",145.3,145.64],["that's",145.64,146.22],["useful",146.22,146.64],["to",146.64,146.88],["know",146.88,147.14],["but",147.14,147.42]]},{"start":147.42,"end":152.42,"text":"if at all possible it is good to talk through the problems you are having at","words":[["if",147.42,148.5],["at",148.5,148.64],["all",148.64,148.78],["possible",148.78,149.26],["it",149.26,149.74],["is",149.74,149.92],["good",149.92,150.12],["to",150.12,150.28],["talk",150.28,150.5],["through",150.5,150.72],["the",150.72,150.9],["problems",150.9,151.3],["you",151.3,151.74],["are",151.74,152.0],["having",152.0,152.28],["at",152.28,152.42]]},{"start":152.42,"end":155.84,"text":"the moment and see if there's any way we can help or that you can help","words":[["the",152.42,152.5],["moment",152.5,152.74],["and",152.74,152.96],["see",152.96,153.1],["if",153.1,153.22],["there's",153.22,153.42],["any",153.42,153.54],["way",153.54,153.78],["we",153.78,154.08],["can",154.08,154.3],["help",154.3,154.58],["or",154.58,155.06],["that",155.06,155.22],["you",155.22,155.44],["can",155.44,155.62],["help",155.62,155.84]]},{"start":155.84,"end":160.52,"text":"yourself. After all, with all the effort that you've put in already, it would be a pity","words":[["yourself.",155.84,156.3],["After",157.0,157.26],["all,",157.26,157.56],["with",157.9,158.08],["all",158.08,158.2],["the",158.2,158.34],["effort",158.34,158.58],["that",158.58,158.82],["you've",158.82,159.0],["put",159.0,159.16],["in",159.16,159.34],["already,",159.34,159.72],["it",159.74,159.96],["would",159.96,160.04],["be",160.04,160.2],["a",160.2,160.32],["pity",160.32,160.52]]},{"start":160.52,"end":162.2,"text":"to have to start all over again.","words":[["to",160.52,160.74],["have",160.74,160.86],["to",160.86,161.0],["start",161.0,161.26],["all",161.26,161.54],["over",161.54,161.8],["again.",161.8,162.2]]},{"start":162.64,"end":167.22,"text":"Oh no, I realise that. And actually, I would like to have a go at staying with economic","words":[["Oh",162.64,162.88],["no,",162.88,163.08],["I",163.2,163.3],["realise",163.3,163.56],["that.",163.56,164.02],["And",164.66,164.82],["actually,",164.82,165.18],["I",165.32,165.44],["would",165.44,165.62],["like",165.62,165.82],["to",165.82,165.98],["have",165.98,166.1],["a",166.1,166.2],["go",166.2,166.3],["at",166.3,166.44],["staying",166.44,166.7],["with",166.7,166.92],["economic",166.92,167.22]]},{"start":167.22,"end":167.8,"text":"history.","words":[["history.",167.22,167.8]]},{"start":168.2,"end":173.86,"text":"Good. Yeah. Well, let's see. Let's talk through some of the problems you've been having.","words":[["Good.",168.2,168.44],["Yeah.",169.0,169.2],["Well,",169.68,169.88],["let's",170.22,170.5],["see.",170.5,170.66],["Let's",171.42,171.78],["talk",171.78,172.0],["through",172.0,172.28],["some",172.28,172.5],["of",172.5,172.62],["the",172.62,172.68],["problems",172.68,172.98],["you've",172.98,173.4],["been",173.4,173.54],["having.",173.54,173.86]]},{"start":174.84,"end":178.22,"text":"What would you say was your major difficulty on the course?","words":[["What",174.84,175.2],["would",175.2,175.44],["you",175.44,175.62],["say",175.62,176.08],["was",176.08,176.46],["your",176.46,176.62],["major",176.62,176.94],["difficulty",176.94,177.56],["on",177.56,177.9],["the",177.9,178.0],["course?",178.0,178.22]]},{"start":178.84,"end":183.62,"text":"I think I'd have to say the worst thing is that I find the lectures difficult.","words":[["I",178.84,179.12],["think",179.12,179.28],["I'd",179.28,179.52],["have",179.52,179.64],["to",179.64,179.84],["say",179.84,180.16],["the",180.16,180.64],["worst",180.64,180.92],["thing",180.92,181.22],["is",181.22,181.46],["that",181.46,181.74],["I",181.74,182.24],["find",182.24,182.48],["the",182.48,182.66],["lectures",182.66,183.08],["difficult.",183.08,183.62]]},{"start":183.62,"end":188.8,"text":"Aha. And how have you tried to overcome this?","words":[["Aha.",183.62,184.44],["And",185.58,186.18],["how",186.18,187.3],["have",187.3,187.52],["you",187.52,187.62],["tried",187.62,187.88],["to",187.88,188.08],["overcome",188.08,188.42],["this?",188.42,188.8]]},{"start":189.34,"end":191.82,"text":"Well, I did try recording lectures, you know.","words":[["Well,",189.34,189.56],["I",189.68,189.84],["did",189.84,189.98],["try",189.98,190.28],["recording",190.28,190.72],["lectures,",190.72,191.32],["you",191.5,191.64],["know.",191.64,191.82]]},{"start":192.06,"end":195.26,"text":"Yes. That's a good idea. And did you 