strategy.",233.14,233.74]]},{"start":234.08,"end":235.8,"text":"It's what all the student handbooks say.","words":[["It's",234.08,234.3],["what",234.3,234.38],["all",234.38,234.56],["the",234.56,234.68],["student",234.68,234.88],["handbooks",234.88,235.4],["say.",235.4,235.8]]},{"start":236.08,"end":236.34,"text":"Yep.","words":[["Yep.",236.08,236.34]]},{"start":236.48,"end":237.44,"text":"And what was the outcome?","words":[["And",236.48,236.66],["what",236.66,236.88],["was",236.88,237.02],["the",237.02,237.18],["outcome?",237.18,237.44]]},{"start":238.1,"end":242.54,"text":"Well, really, just that she's very busy and I have to fit in tutorials when she's","words":[["Well,",238.1,238.36],["really,",238.36,238.78],["just",238.86,239.08],["that",239.08,239.32],["she's",239.32,239.5],["very",239.5,239.74],["busy",239.74,240.14],["and",240.14,240.68],["I",240.68,241.0],["have",241.0,241.14],["to",241.14,241.24],["fit",241.24,241.4],["in",241.4,241.56],["tutorials",241.56,241.92],["when",241.92,242.26],["she's",242.26,242.54]]},{"start":242.54,"end":248.18,"text":"available which is really difficult. I agree it must seem that way. Why don't you","words":[["available",242.54,243.0],["which",243.0,243.56],["is",243.56,243.68],["really",243.68,243.9],["difficult.",243.9,244.3],["I",245.12,245.68],["agree",245.68,245.94],["it",245.94,246.16],["must",246.16,246.26],["seem",246.26,246.58],["that",246.58,246.8],["way.",246.8,247.06],["Why",247.58,247.92],["don't",247.92,248.04],["you",248.04,248.18]]},{"start":248.18,"end":254.84,"text":"try arranging meetings in advance? Well I can certainly give it a go. Yeah. But I","words":[["try",248.18,248.44],["arranging",248.44,249.38],["meetings",249.38,249.84],["in",249.84,250.38],["advance?",250.38,250.74],["Well",251.64,252.04],["I",252.04,252.7],["can",252.7,252.8],["certainly",252.8,253.08],["give",253.08,253.28],["it",253.28,253.36],["a",253.36,253.46],["go.",253.46,253.68],["Yeah.",254.04,254.2],["But",254.52,254.72],["I",254.72,254.84]]},{"start":254.84,"end":259.38,"text":"suppose the thing that's been really upsetting me recently is my bad","words":[["suppose",254.84,255.1],["the",255.1,255.8],["thing",255.8,256.1],["that's",256.1,256.38],["been",256.38,256.58],["really",256.58,256.86],["upsetting",256.86,257.26],["me",257.26,257.58],["recently",257.58,257.96],["is",257.96,258.9],["my",258.9,259.06],["bad",259.06,259.38]]},{"start":259.38,"end":266.08,"text":"assignment grade. How many have you had back? Just the one. Well you could say","words":[["assignment",259.38,259.88],["grade.",259.88,260.4],["How",261.3,261.64],["many",261.64,261.88],["have",261.88,262.16],["you",262.16,262.26],["had",262.26,262.46],["back?",262.46,262.74],["Just",263.56,263.84],["the",263.84,264.06],["one.",264.06,264.28],["Well",264.74,265.26],["you",265.26,265.6],["could",265.6,265.8],["say",265.8,266.08]]},{"start":266.08,"end":270.16,"text":"it was early days yet. Well for the last assignment which we've just handed","words":[["it",266.08,266.22],["was",266.22,266.3],["early",266.3,266.54],["days",266.54,266.82],["yet.",266.82,267.14],["Well",267.54,267.9],["for",267.9,268.1],["the",268.1,268.22],["last",268.22,268.54],["assignment",268.54,269.0],["which",269.0,269.48],["we've",269.48,269.74],["just",269.74,269.86],["handed",269.86,270.16]]},{"start":270.16,"end":276.42,"text":"in. I did more background reading. And did you feel that helped? Oh yes, I think so.","words":[["in.",270.16,270.38],["I",270.84,270.96],["did",270.96,271.1],["more",271.1,271.28],["background",271.28,271.68],["reading.",271.68,272.1],["And",272.5,272.74],["did",272.74,272.96],["you",272.96,273.1],["feel",273.1,273.58],["that",273.58,273.8],["helped?",273.8,274.06],["Oh",274.62,274.86],["yes,",274.86,275.34],["I",275.68,275.86],["think",275.86,276.08],["so.",276.08,276.42]]},{"start":276.96,"end":284.2,"text":"Well, another strategy might be visiting student services. They offer a lot of advice on assignment","words":[["Well,",276.9