e back to discuss the situation, see","words":[["out",302.88,303.18],["our",303.18,303.36],["suggestions",303.36,303.82],["for",303.82,304.28],["a",304.28,304.44],["while",304.44,304.66],["and",304.66,305.04],["then",305.04,305.16],["come",305.16,305.36],["back",305.36,305.66],["to",305.66,306.0],["discuss",306.0,306.68],["the",306.68,306.94],["situation,",306.94,307.4],["see",307.68,308.2]]},{"start":308.2,"end":312.92,"text":"whether it's improved and if not then we can start thinking seriously about","words":[["whether",308.2,308.46],["it's",308.46,308.86],["improved",308.86,309.3],["and",309.3,310.04],["if",310.04,310.18],["not",310.18,310.4],["then",310.4,311.02],["we",311.02,311.16],["can",311.16,311.3],["start",311.3,311.56],["thinking",311.56,311.92],["seriously",311.92,312.44],["about",312.44,312.92]]},{"start":312.92,"end":319.14,"text":"those alternative courses. So you'd like me to come back? Yes let's say in a","words":[["those",312.92,313.26],["alternative",313.26,313.9],["courses.",313.9,314.44],["So",314.88,315.22],["you'd",315.22,315.56],["like",315.56,315.72],["me",315.72,315.88],["to",315.88,316.0],["come",316.0,316.14],["back?",316.14,316.42],["Yes",317.02,317.34],["let's",317.34,318.4],["say",318.4,318.7],["in",318.7,319.04],["a",319.04,319.14]]},{"start":319.14,"end":326.04,"text":"month's time. Okay. That would be on 17th of February at 3.30. Is that","words":[["month's",319.14,319.4],["time.",319.4,319.76],["Okay.",320.2,320.56],["That",321.18,321.5],["would",321.5,321.64],["be",321.64,321.88],["on",321.88,322.5],["17th",322.5,323.34],["of",323.34,323.44],["February",323.44,323.94],["at",323.94,324.8],["3",324.8,325.06],[".30.",325.06,325.46],["Is",325.68,325.9],["that",325.9,326.04]]},{"start":326.04,"end":331.4,"text":"all right? Yeah sure and well I meet with you. I'm afraid I'll be on leave at that","words":[["all",326.04,326.16],["right?",326.16,326.38],["Yeah",326.82,327.1],["sure",327.1,327.48],["and",327.48,328.16],["well",328.16,328.